  "summary": "I’m a Software Engineer with 3+ years of experience delivering backend services and cloud infrastructure on Azure. At Microsoft, I built scalable, highly available systems with 99.9%+ uptime, halved latency across global regions, and automated pipelines that saved hundreds of engineering hours — all while driving reliability, DevOps automation, and security for platforms used by 200+ engineers.\n\nBeyond code, I thrive on problem-solving with others — whether on the basketball court, at the board game table, or in an escape room. The same collaboration and persistence I bring to my hobbies fuel my engineering work: breaking down complex challenges, finding creative solutions, and helping teams win together.\n\nI’m excited to bring my backend and cloud expertise to teams building impactful, customer-facing products. If you’re looking for someone who thrives on tough problems and shared success, let’s connect!",
